<title>USA: Splash sets public offering at $32.50/shr.</title>
<headline>Splash sets public offering at $32.50/shr.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Splash Technology Holdings Inc said Tuesday it priced its public offering of 3.25 million shares of it common stock at $32.50 a share.</p>
<p>Of these shares, 1,340,500 shares are being offered by the company and 1,909,500 shares are being offered by selling stockholders.</p>
<p>The underwriters for the offering are Alex Brown &amp; Sons Inc, Montgomery Securities and Piper Jaffray Inc.</p>
